<h2>Our Methodology: How We Collected and Analyzed the Data</h2>
<p>Before we share findings, here's exactly how we built this dataset — so you can evaluate the conclusions for yourself.</p>
<h3>Sample Selection</h3>
<p>We analyzed <strong>500 Google Business Profiles</strong> belonging to contractors across six trades:</p>
<div class="cost-table">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Trade</th>
<th>Profiles Analyzed</th>
<th>Cities Sampled</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Roofing</td>
<td>95</td>
<td>18</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>HVAC</td>
