<td>Strong negative correlation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>-0.20 to -0.29</td>
<td>Moderate negative correlation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>-0.10 to -0.19</td>
<td>Weak negative correlation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
