</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="callout callout-warning">
<p><strong>Important caveat:</strong> Correlation does not prove causation. A strong correlation between photo count and ranking position might mean photos cause better rankings, or it might mean successful businesses simply upload more photos. We flag causation questions throughout.</p>
</div>
