<h2>Key Finding #4: Post Frequency Creates a Clear Ranking Advantage</h2>
<p><strong>The data:</strong> Post frequency (posts per month) correlated at <strong>-0.28</strong> with ranking position. More interestingly, profiles posting 2+ times per week were <strong>2.3x more likely</strong> to rank in positions 1-3 than profiles posting less than once per month.</p>
