<h2>Key Finding #6: Business Description Length Matters Less Than You Think</h2>
<p><strong>The data:</strong> Business description length correlated at only <strong>-0.09</strong> with ranking position — effectively no relationship.</p>
<p>This contradicts a common piece of GBP advice: "Write a long, keyword-rich business description." We found no evidence that descriptions over 500 characters outperformed descriptions under 200 characters, once other variables were controlled.</p>
