<h3>What Actually Matters in Descriptions</h3>
<p>While length didn't correlate, <strong>keyword presence</strong> did — but only for the primary service + location combination. Profiles whose description included their exact primary service and at least one target city outperformed profiles with generic descriptions, regardless of length.</p>
<p><strong>Example of an effective description (142 characters):</strong></p>
