</blockquote>
<p>The second description is longer but contains zero searchable keywords. It tells a story. It doesn't help Google understand what the business does or where it operates.</p>
<h3>The Action Item</h3>
<p>Write a concise description (150-300 characters) that includes your primary service, your top 2-3 service areas, and one differentiator. Don't waste time on lengthy origin stories or mission statements. The description field is for relevance signaling, not brand storytelling.</p>
